              "_key": "en",
              "value": "Where land meets sea: a snapshot of outdoor enthusiasts embracing the tranquility of beachside camping"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000001b",
          "_pendingImage": "https://travel2egypt.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/Kalawy_Magic_Life_01_2008-1.jpg",
          "_type": "image",
          "alt": [
            {
              "_key": "en",
              "value": "A tranquil beach scene with straw umbrellas and sun loungers overlooking a serene lake with rugged mountains in the background"
            }
          ],
          "caption": [
            {
              "_key": "en",
              "value": "Serenity by the Water – Unwind in the embrace of nature's quietude"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_key": "es",
      "_type": "object",
      "value": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000001",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000000",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Explorar Safaga: una joya costera con una historia que contar"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h2"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000007",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000003",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000002"
              ],
              "text": "Safaga"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000004",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ", una bulliciosa ciudad portuaria de la costa egipcia del Mar Rojo, sirve de centro vital tanto para la exportación de fosfatos locales como de importante terminal de transbordadores a Arabia Saudí."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000005",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000006",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Durante el hajj, se transforma en puerta de peregrinación, donde miles de personas del valle del Nilo inician su viaje sagrado a La Meca."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000002",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "http://travel2egypt.org/es/safaga-excursiones-privadas-de-un-dia/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "http://travel2egypt.org/es/safaga-excursiones-privadas-de-un-dia/",
              "newTab": false
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000009",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000008",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Más allá del Puerto: Un Contraste de Belleza e Industria "
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000015",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000000a",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Aunque el corazón de Safaga late con vigor industrial, se yuxtapone a las impresionantes aguas turquesas y a los vibrantes arrecifes que se extienden mar adentro."
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000b",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000c",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " Puede que la ciudad en sí, con sus calles pragmáticas y cuadriculadas, no cautive inmediatamente por su encanto estético, ya que su paisaje urbano a veces se ve empañado por "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000e",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000000d"
              ],
              "text": "la basura y el"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000f",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " árido bullicio de una ciudad obrera."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000010",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000011",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " Sin embargo, para los entusiastas del windsurf, el submarinismo y "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000013",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000012"
              ],
              "text": "la"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000014",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " relajación junto a la playa, la franja turística del norte de la bahía ofrece una tentadora escapada. "
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000000d",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/es/para-navegar-por-el-nilo/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "https://travel2egypt.org/es/para-navegar-por-el-nilo/",
              "newTab": false
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000012",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/es/m-s-sonesta-diosa-de-la-luna/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "https://travel2egypt.org/es/m-s-sonesta-diosa-de-la-luna/",
              "newTab": false
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000017",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000016",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "La Vía Principal: Puerta a la Aventura"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000001e",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000018",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Safaga se despliega a lo largo de la Sharia al-Gomhuriyya, una arteria principal paralela al paseo marítimo y que se extiende hacia el extremo norte de la ciudad."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000019",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001a",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " Aquí, cerca de "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001c",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000001b"
              ],
              "text": "una rotonda adornada con llamativas esculturas de delfines, se bifurca una carretera que conduce a los aventureros"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001d",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " a la zona turística, donde cobra vida el lado lúdico de la ciudad. "
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000001b",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/es/oasis-de-siwa-una-aventura-epica-eterna/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "https://travel2egypt.org/es/oasis-de-siwa-una-aventura-epica-eterna/",
              "newTab": false
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000020",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000001f",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Windsurf y Deportes Acuáticos: Un paraíso para los entusiastas"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000002f",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000021",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "La reputación de Safaga "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000023",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000022"
              ],
              "text": "como destino principal para"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000024",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " el windsurf es bien merecida."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000025",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000026",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Bendecida con un viento constante del norte, la ciudad es "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000028",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000027"
              ],
              "text": "un patio de recreo para los"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000029",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " deportes acuáticos."
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000002a",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000002b",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Los "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000002d",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000002c"
              ],
              "text": "hoteles de la costa cuentan con"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000002e",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " completos centros de windsurf, además de instalaciones para practicar kitesurf y otras actividades acuáticas, lo que la convierte en un imán para los buscadores de emociones y los amantes del mar."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
